@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam ParticipantPadding 18
skinparam BoxPadding 8
skinparam maxMessageSize 75
hide footbox
autonumber
actor User
boundary "GameFilter/Search UI\n(Client)" as UI
control "Game Route Handler / Action" as Action
control "GameQueryService" as Service
entity "GameRepository" as Repo
control "PromotionService" as Promo
participant "Prisma" as Prisma
database "PostgreSQL" as DB

User -> UI: Nhập từ khóa / bộ lọc / sắp xếp
UI -> Action: search(criteria)
Action -> Service: searchVisibleGames(criteria)
Service -> Service: validate & normalize criteria
Service -> Repo: searchVisible(criteria)
Repo -> Prisma: game.findMany(where/orderBy/...)
Prisma -> DB: SELECT games + relations
DB --> Prisma: Kết quả phân trang
Prisma --> Repo: Games
Repo --> Service: Games
Service -> Promo: resolveDisplayPrices(gameIds)
Promo --> Service: Giá đang áp dụng
Service --> Action: SearchResultDTO
Action --> UI: SearchResultDTO
UI --> User: Hiển thị kết quả
@enduml
